OL,4,CSalon owner's chore woes prompt idea   
OL,5,Cfor new app                            
OL,6,GA salon owner says she was inspired to 
OL,7,Gset up a skill-swapping app after she  
OL,8,Gand her clients spent time "moaning"   
OL,9,Gabout chores and admin.                
OL,11,FMarie King, who owns Finishing Touches 
OL,12,FBeauty, in Leckhampton, Cheltenham,    
OL,13,Fset up Trade Off UK after some of her  
OL,14,Fclients expressed concerns they could  
OL,15,Fno longer afford to get their nails    
OL,16,Fdone, and so they began exchanging     
OL,17,Ftasks like cooking for beauty          
OL,18,Ftreatments.                            
